Question: Determine whether the following two code snippets are semantic code clones.

Code 1: Python
```python
n = int(input())
if n % 2 == 0:
    print("Even")
else:
    print("Odd")
```

Code 2: Java
```java
import java.util.Scanner;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        int n = sc.nextInt();
